          "id": "works.oil_grille",
          "label": "Oil-Bound Works Grille",
          "description": "An oil-slicked safety grille blocks a passage through the abandoned works. A distant maintenance lever provides a slow manual route; heat can clear the binding or a Fire Bomb can cut through it. Each method permanently opens the same passage.",
